1454:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_eth.c ****  /**
1455:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_eth.c ****   * @brief  Enables Ethernet MAC and DMA reception/transmission 
1456:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_eth.c ****   * @param  heth pointer to a ETH_HandleTypeDef structure that contains
1457:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_eth.c ****   *         the configuration information for ETHERNET module
1458:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_eth.c ****   * @retval HAL status
